ngemeenschap aan de Theems. Een charismatische arts wil daar de middenklasse bevrijden van haar vertrouwde plichten en bezit. Markham raakt betrokken bij acties die steeds verder gaan. Ballard onderzoekt hoe onvrede juist in een comfortabele omgeving kan uitgroeien tot geweld en hoe een persoonlijk onderzoek iemand in die beweging kan meeslepen.","work_id":987147046,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work6078 Millennium people / J. G. Ballard; exact Dutch Millenniummensen ISBN 9789029504591 paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-033.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p265449545"],"reference":"work:6078","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-033.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL2745947W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p265449545"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789029504591","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_source_failure_no_retry","coverId":11958730,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.999Z","editionKey":"/books/OL27624275M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works